* LM833 high-speed audio bipolar dual op-amp, ±18 V max (our model from TI's sheet)
* Built by Solum Builder from TI LM833 data sheet SLOS481B (revised October 2014), at ±15 V (D-162)
.subckt LM833 1 2 3 4 5
* pins: + - V+ V- out. Built by Solum Builder from the sheet's typical figures (D-162)
Rin 1 2 1e+12
Rc1 1 mid 1e12
Rc2 2 mid 1e12
Emid mid 4 3 4 0.5
Bgm mid g I=1e-05*tanh(9.86188*(V(1)-V(2)))
R1 g mid 3.20657e+09
C1 g mid 1.42857e-12
Vhp 3 hp DC 0.848
Vhn hn 4 DC 0.346
Dhi g hp DCLAMP
Dlo hn g DCLAMP
Ebuf b 0 g 0 1
Rp b p 1000
Cp p 0 1.23824e-11
Eout o 0 p 0 1
Vsense o o2 0
Rout o2 5 37
Bsrc 3 0 I=max(i(Vsense),0)
Bsnk 0 4 I=max(-i(Vsense),0)
Iq 3 4 DC 0.00205
.model DCLAMP D(is=1e-15 n=0.05)
.ends
